g_gen.go -check`; `go test ./... -v`; `go test ./... -cover`; `go build ./...` | Read-only traceability report; owner-only roots, immutable blob/quarantine data, and `<state>/index.sqlite` plus recovery evidence only when storage entries are called; `internal/catalog/catalog_gen.go`; Go build/fuzz cache; test output captured under `.temp/<TASK-ID>/` when needed |
