+- `go test ./... -cover` — `.temp/TASK-260909-2ez769/go-test-cover-01.log`; Config 93.5%, Host Trust Store 77.5%.
+- `go vet ./...` — `.temp/TASK-260909-2ez769/go-vet-01.log`.
