+- EVIDENCE: `go test ./... -count=1` exit 0 (`.temp/TASK-260909-2ez769/go-test-all-01.log`); `go test ./... -cover` exit 0 (`config 93.5%`, `hosttrust 77.5%`, `.temp/TASK-260909-2ez769/go-test-cover-01.log`); `go vet ./...`, native build, GOOS=windows build/vet, gofmt, and `git diff --check` all exit 0. Census run: `writepath-census-02.log`. Narrowing mutants: `hold-resource-skip` killed by `TestHeldExclusiveRejectsUnboundConfigPath`; `replace-require-skip` killed by zero-hold production tests; token-preserving `writepath-method-value-skip` killed by `TestWritePathGateFlagsExecutableRogues/backend_method_value`. Raw mutation JSON/table are under `.temp/TASK-260909-2ez769/mutations-{hold-resource,config-hold,writepath}-*/`.
+- COVERAGE RATIO: 19 of 21 previously enumerated production acceptance rows are driven by named entry-point tests; 2 remain stated bounds (Windows runtime DACL execution and a future export/replication consumer surface absent from this repository). No claim is made for those bounds.
